{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj4HQWv7oQbt72LMvTv2","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*The door stands before you — ancient oak, iron-banded, weathered by centuries of seekers.*\n\n*A keyhole glows faintly at its center.*\n\n*You hold up the key.*\n\n*The door examines it.*\n\n...\n\n*The tumblers do not turn.*\n\nA key alone is not enough. Any key can be cut. Any key can be copied.\n\n**Which key?**\n\n*The keyhole waits, patient as stone.*"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":41,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":106,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}